function Normalize($value,$self){if($null -eq $value){return $null};if($value -is [Reflection.FieldAttributes]){return 'self:'+([object]::ReferenceEquals($value,$self).ToString().ToLowerInvariant())};if($value -is [string]){return 'System.String:'+$value};if($value -is [bool]){return 'System.Boolean:'+$value.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()};if($value -is [char]){return 'System.Char:'+([int]$value).ToString()};if($value -is [single]){return 'System.Single:'+([BitConverter]::SingleToInt32Bits($value).ToString('X8'))};if($value -is [double]){return 'System.Double:'+([BitConverter]::DoubleToInt64Bits($value).ToString('X16'))};return $value.GetType().FullName+':'+([IFormattable]$value).ToString($null,[Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture)}
function FieldMeta($f){$parts=[Collections.Generic.List[string]]::new();$parts.Add($f.Name);$parts.Add($f.DeclaringType.FullName);$parts.Add($f.ReflectedType.FullName);$parts.Add($f.FieldType.FullName);$parts.Add(([int]$f.Attributes).ToString());$parts.Add($f.ToString());foreach($p in @('IsPublic','IsPrivate','IsFamily','IsAssembly','IsFamilyAndAssembly','IsFamilyOrAssembly','IsStatic','IsInitOnly','IsLiteral','IsSpecialName','IsNotSerialized','IsPinvokeImpl','IsCollectible')){$parts.Add(([Reflection.FieldInfo].GetProperty($p).GetValue($f)).ToString().ToLowerInvariant())};return $parts -join '#'}
function Scalar($result){if($result -is [string]){return 'System.String:'+($result)};if($result -is [char]){return 'System.Char:'+([int]$result)};if($result -is [single]){return 'System.Single:'+([BitConverter]::SingleToInt32Bits($result).ToString('X8'))};if($result -is [double]){return 'System.Double:'+([BitConverter]::DoubleToInt64Bits($result).ToString('X16'))};return $result.GetType().FullName+':'+([IFormattable]$result).ToString($null,[Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture)}
function EnumScalar($value){if($null -eq $value){return '~'};return $value.GetType().FullName+':'+([IFormattable]$value).ToString($null,[Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture)}
$plan=Get-Content -LiteralPath $PlanPath -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json;$rows=[Collections.Generic.List[object]]::new();$type=[Reflection.MethodImplAttributes];$actual=$type.GetFields([Reflection.BindingFlags]'Public,Static').Name;if(($actual -join ';') -ne ($plan.names -join ';')){throw 'MethodImplAttributes declaration order differs from recorded names'}
foreach($case in $plan.cases){$value=$null;$errorName='none';$message=$null;$hResult=0;$param=$null;$after=$null;try{$flags=[Enum]::ToObject([Reflection.BindingFlags],[int]$case.flags);if($case.route -eq 'Fields'){$value=(($type.GetFields($flags)|ForEach-Object {FieldMeta $_})-join ';')}else{$invoke=[object[]]::new(2);$invoke[0]=$case.field;$invoke[1]=$flags;$field=[Type].GetMethod('GetField',[Type[]]@([string],[Reflection.BindingFlags])).Invoke($type,$invoke);if($case.route -eq 'Field'){if($null -ne $field){$value=FieldMeta $field}}else{$target=switch($case.target){'Null'{$null};'Object'{[object]::new()};'Own'{[Enum]::ToObject([Reflection.MethodImplAttributes],-123)};'Other'{[Reflection.FieldAttributes]::Public};'String'{'target'};'RuntimeType'{[int]}};switch($case.operation){'Value'{$value=EnumScalar ($field.GetValue($target))};'Raw'{$value=EnumScalar ($field.GetRawConstantValue())};'Pair'{$a=$field.GetValue($target);$b=$field.GetValue($target);$value=(EnumScalar $a)+'|'+(EnumScalar $b)+'|'+([object]::ReferenceEquals($a,$b)).ToString().ToLowerInvariant()};'Write'{try{$field.SetValue($target,$null)}finally{$after=EnumScalar ($field.GetValue($null))}};default{throw 'unknown operation'}}}}}catch{$errorValue=$_.Exception;while($errorValue -is [Reflection.TargetInvocationException] -or $errorValue -is [Management.Automation.MethodInvocationException]){$errorValue=$errorValue.InnerException};$errorName=$errorValue.GetType().FullName;$message=$errorValue.Message;$hResult=$errorValue.HResult;if($errorValue -is [ArgumentException]){$param=$errorValue.ParamName}};$rows.Add([ordered]@{id=$case.id;valueUnits=(Units $value);exception=$errorName;messageUnits=(Units $message);hResult=$hResult;paramUnits=(Units $param);afterUnits=(Units $after)})}
$record=[ordered]@{schemaVersion=1;runtimeVersion=[Environment]::Version.ToString();coreLibSha256=$coreHash;oracleSha256=(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $PSCommandPath -Algorithm SHA256).Hash.ToLowerInvariant();planSha256=(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $PlanPath -Algorithm SHA256).Hash.ToLowerInvariant();rows=$rows.ToArray();qualification=$plan.qualification};[IO.File]::WriteAllText($OutputPath,($record|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 14 -Compress)+"`n",[Text.UTF8Encoding]::new($false));Write-Output "PASS MethodImplAttributes field inventory capture: $($rows.Count) requests"
